" baseline;\"=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (교육 대상 및 관련 학과)</span></div><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"20607\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" nanum=\"\" gothic\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-variant:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" text-size-adjust:=\"\" none;=\"\" -webkit-tap-highlight-color:=\"\" rgba(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 0);=\"\" margin:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" padding:=\"\" border:=\"\" font-stretch:=\"\" line-height:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">- 대학(전문대학)교 환경관련학과 졸업(예정)자 및 미취업자 (35명/회차당)</span></div><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"20607\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" nanum=\"\" gothic\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" inherit;=\"\" font-variant:=\"\" font-weight:=\"\" text-size-adjust:=\"\" none;=\"\" -webkit-tap-highlight-color:=\"\" rgba(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 0);=\"\" margin:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" padding:=\"\" border:=\"\" font-stretch:=\"\" line-height:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\" baseline;\"=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">4. 선발방식</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 지원자 서류 검토 후 선발(선발대상자는 문자로 개별 통보)</span><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6704\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: inherit; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><p style=\"border: 0px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">5. 지원내용</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 이론교육 및 현장실습 지원(총 12주)</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">- 산업체 현장실무형 전문(이론)교육(6주)</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">- 현장 직무 이해도 제고를 위한 산업체 현장실습(6주)</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 취업역량강화교육 및 1:1 취업상담 실시</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 기업체 인사담당자 취업 특강 및 간담회&nbsp;실시</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">6. 수강혜택</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (교육비) 무료</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (수료증) 한국환경산업기술원장 명의의 수료증 수여</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (취업박람회) 일자리 박람회 참가 및 취업연계 지원</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (훈련장려금) 개인별 훈련장려금 지급(최대 116,000원/월)</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ (상장수여) 우수 수료생 한국환경산업기술원장 상장 수여</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">7. 신청방법</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 환경기술 전문인력 양성과정 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://www.eduet.or.kr)/\">www.eduet.or.kr)</a>&nbsp;온라인 신청서 제출</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">◦ ‘국민내일배움카드’ 발급 신청</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">- 직업훈련포털(<a href=\"http://www.hrd.go.kr)/\">www.hrd.go.kr)</a>&nbsp;또는 거주지 관할 고용복지플러스센터</span></p><div data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"10551\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: inherit; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 2; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">8. 문의처</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">◦ 한국환경산업기술원 기업육성실</span><br style=\"text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\"><span nanum=\"\" gothic\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">- 담당자 : 02-2284-1719, 02-2284-1718 / 이메일 : hjkim@keiti.re.kr</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
